    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Faisal Qureshi, an alumnus from AKU's MBBS class of 1993, has to balance a number of responsibilities in his medical career. Besides being a busy paediatric surgeon at the University of Texas Southwestern's teaching hospital, he is also a prolific medical researcher and one of the main figures overseeing the recruitment and education of young surgeons through the institution's residency programme.",
